    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmotiles turns planet terraform experience into a peaceful strategy game and does so with style. It offers a simple  game mechanic. At the same time, provides enough depth for challenging and rewarding experience for seekers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337660/extras/fe6af0268e213c17ddc572f6bf8b265e.avif?t=1753205259\" width=616 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to place blocks on planet. A block is a group of tiles with a same biome. Placing a block is scored  based on surrounding biomes. The more strategically you place your blocks, the more points you score. Once you score enough points, a new planet is unlocked to continue expedition. However, if you run out of empty tiles to place blocks, the game ends. This is the time when you check your score on the leaderboard and start a new expedition.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337660/extras/2dc121a3480dfa1a3762af14839be560.avif?t=1753205259\" width=616 height=77 /></span>What Cosmotiles offers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless amount of procedurally generated planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful relaxing and calming experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mix of strategy and puzzle mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value - every session is different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic placement to beat the highscore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for playing now and then</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Cosmotiles does <strong>not</strong> offer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4X Strategy   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat &amp; Violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cinematic story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>The game is inspired from amazing games like ISLANDERS and Dorfromantik. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmotiles turns planet terraform experience into a peaceful strategy game and does so with style. It offers a simple  game mechanic. At the same time, provides enough depth for challenging and rewarding experience for seekers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337660/extras/fe6af0268e213c17ddc572f6bf8b265e.avif?t=1753205259\" width=616 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to place blocks on planet. A block is a group of tiles with a same biome. Placing a block is scored  based on surrounding biomes. The more strategically you place your blocks, the more points you score. Once you score enough points, a new planet is unlocked to continue expedition. However, if you run out of empty tiles to place blocks, the game ends. This is the time when you check your score on the leaderboard and start a new expedition.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337660/extras/2dc121a3480dfa1a3762af14839be560.avif?t=1753205259\" width=616 height=77 /></span>What Cosmotiles offers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless amount of procedurally generated planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful relaxing and calming experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mix of strategy and puzzle mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value - every session is different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic placement to beat the highscore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for playing now and then</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Cosmotiles does <strong>not</strong> offer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4X Strategy   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat &amp; Violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cinematic story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>The game is inspired from amazing games like ISLANDERS and Dorfromantik. </p>",
